      "text": "\n#35 归档双语补齐\n门下\n等 agent\n你 21:52 的判「基本认可，加到 wiki 里…」还没 agent 认领\n你不用动\n"
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "tag": "p",
      "line": 23,
      "lineEnd": 23,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "三个发现："
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 25,
      "lineEnd": 25,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "9 折里真要你从头读的只有 5 个（#41→#57→#44→#60→#55）。两个灰折各只需你一句话处置。"
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 26,
      "lineEnd": 26,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "#58 的批不在任何折面上。 「主选 Hetzner」「域名推迟」批在会话里，#58 与 #59 的折面都没有痕迹——拍板散落在涂归、判、聊天三处，折堆自己不会说话。这不是哪次的疏忽，是机制缺口（§二）。"
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 27,
      "lineEnd": 28,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "中书门下现在真正卡住的不是折，是行动：#59 批完后欠的 Hetzner 注册＋租机（证件核验要你本人）。折堆清空这条也不会自己消失。"
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "type": "heading",
      "tag": "h2",
      "line": 29,
      "lineEnd": 29,
      "parent": null,
      "level": 2,
      "text": "二 · 病根与需求"
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "tag": "p",
      "line": 31,
      "lineEnd": 31,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "速度失配：7/29 至今画可 30 折、在批 9 折——产折是 AI 速度，读折是人速度。堆一旦超过短期记忆容量，「哪个 block 哪个、哪个已被盖」就只能靠翻。这正是 #60 问的「专读 AI 产出」该长的肌肉，也是中书门下 M2 排序的前置数据（#56-F5 砍掉内置排序后，排序信号本来就该先在数据侧长出来）。"
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "tag": "p",
      "line": 33,
      "lineEnd": 33,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "病根三条："
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 34,
      "lineEnd": 34,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "呈折不声明——项目归属与关系全埋在标题措辞里（#50 标题里的「取代 #48」就是关系声明，只是机器读不到）；"
    },
    {
      "i": 25,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 35,
      "lineEnd": 35,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "拍板不落面——会话里批的决定，折面无痕（#58 案）；"
    },
    {
      "i": 26,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 36,
      "lineEnd": 37,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "画可不闭环——#59 画可时，没人处置被它盖掉的 #58。"
    },
    {
      "i": 27,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "tag": "p",
      "line": 38,
      "lineEnd": 38,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "需求："
    },
    {
      "i": 28,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 39,
      "lineEnd": 39,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "R1 呈折时由 agent 声明项目、种类、关系（依赖 / 覆盖 / 解锁什么）——工具焊入，无人手填表。"
    },
    {
      "i": 29,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 40,
      "lineEnd": 40,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "R2 待审清单按项目分组，折卡带「等谁」徽章与关系链。"
    },
    {
      "i": 30,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 41,
      "lineEnd": 41,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "R3 「等谁」四态可见：等你拍 / 等你读 / 等 agent / 闲。"
    },
    {
      "i": 31,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 42,
      "lineEnd": 42,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "R4 覆盖闭环：画可带 supersedes 声明的折时，被盖折当场处置（close＋判词）；巡检报失配。"
    },
    {
      "i": 32,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 43,
      "lineEnd": 43,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "R5 存量 9 折立即可用（backfill），不等新折。"
    },
    {
      "i": 33,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 44,
      "lineEnd": 45,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "R6 数据全长在 GitHub 原生对象上：无新存储、无后端；中书门下 M2/M4 直接消费同一字段。"
    },
    {
      "i": 34,
      "type": "heading",
      "tag": "h2",
      "line": 46,
      "lineEnd": 46,
      "parent": null,
      "level": 2,
      "text": "三 · 设计"
    },
    {
      "i": 35,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "tag": "p",
      "line": 48,
      "lineEnd": 48,
      "parent": null,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "i": 36,
      "type": "heading",
      "tag": "h3",
      "line": 50,
      "lineEnd": 50,
      "parent": null,
      "level": 3,
      "text": "3.1 数据放哪：labels（状态）＋ 尾行标记（关系），双轨"
    },
    {
      "i": 37,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "tag": "p",
      "line": 52,
      "lineEnd": 52,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "labels——可变状态，GitHub 原生可筛、自带颜色："
    },
    {
      "i": 38,
      "type": "table",
      "tag": "table",
      "line": 54,
      "lineEnd": 58,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "\n\n\n前缀\n取值\n说明\n\n\n\n\nproj:\nzhongshumenxia / menxia / niw / guanzhi / …\n开放集；agent 起新词前先查现有 labels；词表登记进门下 wiki\n\n\nkind:\n拍板 / 评审 / 设计 / 读物 / 交付 / 参考\n主用途取一\n\n\nwait:\n你拍（红）/ 你读（黄）/ agent（蓝）/ 闲（灰）\n阅读器直接用 label 颜色，零映射表\n\n\n"
    },
    {
      "i": 39,
      "type": "table_row",
      "tag": "tr",
      "line": 54,
      "lineEnd": 54,
      "parent": 38,
      "text": "\n前缀\n取值\n说明\n"
    },
    {
      "i": 40,
      "type": "table_row",
      "tag": "tr",
      "line": 56,
      "lineEnd": 56,
      "parent": 38,
      "text": "\nproj:\nzhongshumenxia / menxia / niw / guanzhi / …\n开放集；agent 起新词前先查现有 labels；词表登记进门下 wiki\n"
    },
    {
      "i": 41,
      "type": "table_row",
      "tag": "tr",
      "line": 57,
      "lineEnd": 57,
      "parent": 38,
      "text": "\nkind:\n拍板 / 评审 / 设计 / 读物 / 交付 / 参考\n主用途取一\n"
    },
    {
      "i": 42,
      "type": "table_row",
      "tag": "tr",
      "line": 58,
      "lineEnd": 58,
      "parent": 38,
      "text": "\nwait:\n你拍（红）/ 你读（黄）/ agent（蓝）/ 闲（灰）\n阅读器直接用 label 颜色，零映射表\n"
    },
    {
      "i": 43,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "tag": "p",
      "line": 60,
      "lineEnd": 60,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "body 尾行标记——一次性声明的关系边（与 happy-session 同族，读者不可见）："
    },
    {
      "i": 44,
      "type": "code_block",
      "tag": "pre",
      "line": 62,
      "lineEnd": 62,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "<!-- menxia-rel: needs=#49; supersedes=#48,#50; unblocks=T1.2 租机链 -->\n"
    },
    {
      "i": 45,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 64,
      "lineEnd": 64,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "needs=#N：本折依赖 #N 的结论；"
    },
    {
      "i": 46,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 65,
      "lineEnd": 65,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "supersedes=#N：本折覆盖/取代 #N；"
    },
    {
      "i": 47,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 66,
      "lineEnd": 66,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "unblocks=<短语>：画可后解锁什么（自由文本，禁分号）；"
    },
    {
      "i": 48,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 67,
      "lineEnd": 68,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "多项目折允许多个 proj: label，阅读器按第一个分组。"
    },
    {
      "i": 49,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "tag": "p",
      "line": 69,
      "lineEnd": 69,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "单点定义：词表常量只在 menxia-mcp 一处定义；阅读器只认前缀（proj: / kind: / wait:），不硬编码取值全集——改名的教训：跨系统契约是裸字符串，两头写死必静默失效。"
    },
    {
      "i": 50,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "tag": "p",
      "line": 71,
      "lineEnd": 71,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "为什么不是别的："
    },
    {
      "i": 51,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 72,
      "lineEnd": 72,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "GitHub Projects / milestone：第二块阅读面，违背 attention-hub 初衷；Projects 写入要 GraphQL、移动端弱；milestone 单亲装不下多项目。"
    },
    {
      "i": 52,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 73,
      "lineEnd": 73,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "本地状态文件（processed.json 那类）：阅读器跑在浏览器里，看不见 Mac 上的文件；关系必须公开长在折上。"
    },
    {
      "i": 53,
      "type": "list_item",
      "tag": "li",
      "line": 74,
      "lineEnd": 75,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "AI 语义自动判覆盖：误报要人擦屁股。声明优先；语义扫描只做定期巡检的兜底（§3.4），不进机制。"
    },
    {
      "i": 54,
      "type": "heading",
      "tag": "h3",
      "line": 76,
      "lineEnd": 76,
      "parent": null,
      "level": 3,
      "text": "3.2 写入侧（menxia-mcp）"
    },
    {
      "i": 55,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "tag": "p",
      "line": 78,
      "lineEnd": 78,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "open_folder 增 track 参数：{ proj, kind, needs?, supersedes?, unblocks? } → 贴 labels（幂等，缺则按定色新建）＋ 焊尾行标记。不传 track 出 warning，不硬拦（与 body 缺段同级）。"
    },
    {
      "i": 56,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "tag": "p",
      "line": 80,
      "lineEnd": 80,
      "parent": null,
      "text": "溯改老折只 close 不改 body：给存量折补关系一律「close ＋ 判词 comment」，不碰老折 body——别惊动 happy-session 标记。"
    },
    {
      "i": 57,
      "type": "heading",
      "tag": "h3",
      "line": 82,
      "lineEnd": 82,
      "parent": null,
      "level": 3,
      "text": "3.3 阅读侧（menxia）"
    },
    {
      "i": 58,
      "type": "paragraph",
      "tag": "p",
      "line": 84,
      "lineEnd": 84,
      "parent": null,
